cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Multi Energy Model Execution (MEME)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free Go service that translates one canonical energy-system
  model into the native inputs of PyPSA, Calliope (0.7 and 0.6) and
  AdOpT-NET0, runs the solvers, and returns the results as one bundle through
  a REST API.
authors:
